OL,3,GNEWSACCTV helps catch fly-tipping and
OL,4,Aarson incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV cameras set up at fly-tipping
OL,7,Fhotspots have also helped catch
OL,8,Flitterers and an arsonist, council
OL,9,Fbosses have said.
OL,11,FTemporary cameras were deployed in July
OL,12,Fby South Hams District Council in Devon
OL,13,Fin locations it said were known to be
OL,14,Fused by people fly-tipping - the
OL,15,Fillegal dumping of waste or rubbish.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
