OL,3,GNEWSACCTV helps catch fly-tipping and
OL,4,Aarson incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said since being rolled
OL,7,Fout, the cameras have caught people
OL,8,Fcarrying out seven fly-tipping
OL,9,Fincidents, which can lead to offenders
OL,10,Fbeing given an on-the-spot fine of up
OL,11,Fto #5,000 along with having to face a
OL,12,Fpotential court case.
OL,14,FIt added five littering incidents and
OL,15,Fan arson had been identified by the
OL,16,Fcameras since they were installed.
